  "legacy_eligibility": "Dragon Survival verified species and real growth gates",
  "notes": [
    "Do not turn Forest Dragon neutrality into global creature pacification.",
    "Sourceberries and modded enchanted golden carrot diets are separate food tags, not a skill gate.",
    "Green Thumb and Shepherd's Blessing are existing Tyz IMMUTABLE skills; propose same-ID Forest Dragon relocation, with real species-state use checks and no double-harvest multipliers.",
    "No Forest Dragon mana regeneration talents; its Green Recovery/Elder Grove refer only to health recovery, never mana.",
    "Power budget reference is a comparably advanced MONK WITH NO WORN EQUIPMENT against THIS TREE WITH APPROPRIATELY-TIERED FULLY ENCHANTED/APOTHEOSIS-AFFIXED GEAR. Endgame balance targets broadly similar whole-build ability, with only slight role-specific advantages.",
    "Dragon gear-inclusive magic capability must slightly surpass gearless Monk in maximum personal mana and practical spell power after armor/Curios/wands, enchantments and Apotheosis affixes; recalibrate prior Extreme mana/potency skill percentages against total equipped output before approving numbers."
